}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datastructures/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaDataStructureId}}
}

docs {
  ## Cleanup – Delete DataStructure

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataStructureId` is set.

  Deleting the data structure also cascades to its versions.

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `204 No Content`

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataStructure and associated versions removed from `portal_backend` DB |
  | Model Atlas / Apicurio Registry | Schema artifacts removed from registry |
}
